+// Profiler-only in-situ matmul probe, run once per launch before the counts handshake, while the reader
+// is still fetching counts and planning (this kernel's compute has nothing to do then). It is one gate and
+// one up subblock of the gate/up K-loop exactly as matmul_phase_fused_gu issues them -- same init, the
