+// runs at most two unpack contexts ahead of MATH, so a cycle spent here is a cycle the FPU has no data
+// queued. At kernel end UNPACK emits 4 "RE-UW" records: [63:56] pair index, [55:28] and [27:0] the
+// pair's two slots.
